+## Sound
+
+All audio is synthesized at runtime through libogc's ASND — there are no
+sound assets in the repo:
+
+- **Engine:** one cycle of a buzzy square-plus-harmonics waveform played
+  as an infinite voice, whose sample rate and volume are retuned every
+  frame from the player kart's speed (and pushed up a little while a
+  boost is running).
+- **Countdown:** a 440 Hz beep on each of 3, 2, 1, then a longer 880 Hz
+  chime on GO.
+- **Boost:** a low 220 Hz sting whenever you pick up a boost pad or cash
+  in a drift mini-turbo.
+
